      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "**Home Assistant release with the issue:** 0.98\r\n**Last working Home Assistant release (if known):** -\r\n**Component/platform:** Cloud + any webhook config flow\r\n**Description of problem:**\r\nIf a user is subscribed to the cloud, any webhook config flow + OwnTracks/SmartThings will automatically create a cloudhook.\r\n\r\nWe should allow an option in `configuration.yaml` to allow disabling this.\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\ncloud:\r\n  disable_automatic_cloudhook: true\r\n```\r\n\r\nOriginally reported in #24747\r\n",
